 en from Diu.\nThe Moon is 41° up in the SW · daylight\, Sun +23°.\nTime
 s against the real lunar limb.\nMap\, timings and the view at the Moon's e
 dge: https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?city=Diu
